@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Historical / alternative. Dated observation or rejected/unselected alternative is preserved without becoming a current MVP topology.
allowmixing
title HISTORICAL / UNSELECTED — Proposed — Design evolution timeline and ADR history
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

rectangle "November 2 historical proposals\nADR-001 former common-app boundaries\nADR-002 publication / history\nADR-003 durable external attempts" as A
rectangle "Current documentation package\nNovember 2, 2026\nExamples and engineering procedure" as B
rectangle "Proposed evolution decision\nADR-004 compatible incremental change\nStatus: Proposed" as C
rectangle "November 4: OWNER-MVP and ADR-005 accepted boundary\nCore / separate ProjectForge API\nADR-001 superseded in part; ADR-002–004 technical proposals remain" as D
A --> B : context, not acceptance
B --> C : records recommendation
C --> D : conditional next steps

@enduml
